cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use irshape, please cite the software and the accompanying manuscript."
title: "irshape: a corrected, coverage-shape-aware intron retention engine"
abstract: >
  irshape quantifies intron retention (IR) directly from recount3's precomputed
  coverage, applying a corrected intronic mask and a per-length-tier
  coverage-shape layer on top of the IRFinder principle.
